{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"capable-moist-coot","creation_channel":"mcp","description":"## Context / Problem\nThe tests/unit cohort contains audited comments or docstrings that obscure current behavior with repetition, obvious narration, duplicated explanation, or historical detail. The audit is pinned to `9e65567b79ffe872534c3c656ade7b34340d8192`.\n\n## Approach\nEdit explanatory text only in this directory/subsystem cohort. Condense it to current, non-obvious rationale and constraints; retain every file-specific preserve item and consumer contract below. Grouping adjacent files from one subsystem keeps the change reviewable in one session and permits one coherent verification pass without changing executable behavior.\n\n## Scope\n- `tests/unit/evals/test_plan_replay_corpus.py:1-16` — Preserve historical-object recovery, timestamp-bounded reconstruction, legacy fingerprint compatibility, and offline execution. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/io/test_git_counts_helper.py:1-10` — Preserve retry and diagnostic-error expectations. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_worktree_python_pin.py:1-12` — Preserve CI-version virtualenv provisioning. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_write_lock_busy_probe_7084.py:1-13` — Preserve nonblocking compaction lock probing. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/workflow/test_terraform_plan_review_tools.py:178-183` — Preserve that Pass-1 tools travel through `RunRequest.extra_tools` via the criterion hook. Consumer: none found.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" pytest tests/unit/evals/test_plan_replay_corpus.py tests/unit/io/test_git_counts_helper.py tests/unit/test_worktree_python_pin.py tests/unit/test_write_lock_busy_probe_7084.py tests/unit/workflow/test_terraform_plan_review_tools.py`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule.","id":"744b-6822-b9a6-435a","parent_id":"ae4d-df34-480d-4c88","priority":3,"repos":["rebar"],"tags":["comments","documentation","maintainability","grouped-remediation"],"ticket_type":"task","title":"Condense comments in tests/unit — cohort 02: plan_replay_corpus–terraform_plan_review_tools"},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1788571233315832755,"uuid":"47f00f30-557e-47b9-b0fc-5d336a521a4c"}